 .../exllamav3_ext/libtorch/attention_bc.h     |   1 +
 exllamav3/modules/attention_fn/bc_attn.py     |  20 +-
 .../modules/attention_fn/triton_paged.py      | 259 +++++++++++++++++-
 6 files changed, 301 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/doc/env_vars.md b/doc/env_vars.md
index e203023..a6ea9bc 100644
--- a/doc/env_vars.md
+++ b/doc/env_vars.md
@@ -51,6 +51,37 @@ Print one line per attention module/cache-layer pair when the graph-captured dec
 built or declined (module key, device). Activation check for A/B tests: a benchmark comparing
 `EXL3_BC_ATTN` settings is only meaningful if the enabled run actually built the path.
 
+### `EXL3_DEC_GROUP` (default: `0`)
+
+Split-decode attention, graph-captured and eager: a program normally takes 16 query rows
+(q_len x GQA heads), so a multi-token verify (q_len 8, group of 6) spreads one GQA group over
+several programs, each re-reading and re-dequantizing the same K/V tiles. `1` gives each
+program the whole group (q_len x next_pow2(group) rows, at least 16) and, unless
+`EXL3_DEC_SPLIT_MULT` is set, aims for 8 (single-token) or 4 (multi-token) programs per CU
+instead of 2. Tuned on gfx1201.
+
+### `EXL3_DEC_BLOCK_H` (default: unset)
+
+GQA heads per split-decode program while `EXL3_DEC_GROUP` is off; a power of two.
+
+### `EXL3_DEC_SPLIT_MULT` (default: unset)
+
+Programs per CU (a float) the split-decode split count aims for.
+
+### `EXL3_DEC_WARPS`, `EXL3_DEC_STAGES`, `EXL3_DEC_BLOCK_N` (default: unset)
+
+Override the split-decode kernel's warps, pipeline stages and kv tile (powers of two; stages
+non-negative) over the per-backend / per-architecture defaults (`attn_decode_config` in
+`exllamav3/util/backend.py`). Each applies on its own, in the eager launch and the
+graph-captured build alike; explicit arguments to `paged_attn_triton_decode` still win. A set
+`EXL3_DEC_BLOCK_N` replaces the shared-memory ladder with that one tile.
+
+### `EXL3_DEC_Q4W` (default: `0`)
+
+Word-sliced split-decode kernel for 4-bit K and V caches (head_dim a power of two, at least 128):
+each tile's packed words are loaded once and the dots split into 8 per-nibble partial dots,
+instead of unpacking through an LDS shuffle. 1.2-1.3x the packed kernel on gfx1201 at q_len 4-8.
+
 ### `EXL3_BC_DSA` (default: `1`)
 
 DeepSeek-V4 counterpart of `EXL3_BC_ATTN`: for decode steps (bsz 1, q_len ≤ 16) the whole DSA
